{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:634","content":{"id":634,"title":"棒球比赛","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"看一个使用最大流解决实际问题的例子，那就是棒球比赛。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"全美每年都会举行一次棒球比赛，每个队都要进行 $162$ 场比赛，最终所胜的场次最多的队伍获胜，如果平局就进行加赛。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是如果在比赛的过程中，某一队已经没有获得冠军的希望了，那么该队就会被直接淘汰。例如 A 队已经赢了 10 场了，而 B 队只赢了 1 场，并且还有 8 场比赛没有打，此时 $B$ 队如何也不能赢的场次比 A 队多，所以 B 队应该被淘汰。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在我们拿到了 1996 年 8 月 30 日真实的比赛数据，此时只剩下 5 个队"}]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Teams"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Wins"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Loss"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Left"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Against"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"NY"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Bal"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"BOS"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Tor"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Det"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"New York"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"75"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"59"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"28"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"8"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"7"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Baltimore"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"71"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"63"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"28"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"7"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"4"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Boston"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"69"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"66"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"27"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"8"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Toronto"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"63"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"72"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"27"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"7"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"7"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Detroit"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"49"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"86"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"27"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"4"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Wins 代表赢了多少场，Loss 表示输了多少场，Left 表示剩余多少场没有打，Against 后面的 5 列表示与其他队要打多少场。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当时媒体争议的是最后一个队，即 Detroit 队还有没有获胜的希望。从数据上看，如果 Detroit 剩下的  场全赢，那么它的赢的总场次是 ，比最强的 New York 还多一场，所以它还有赢的机会，但是这样想的话就忽略了一个事实，即使 Detroit 与其他四队的比赛都打赢了，但是这四个队之间还有比赛，也就说说这四个队它们的总胜场是会增加的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以现在又变为了这么一个问题，如果前四个队之间比赛，如果最终它们的胜场最多是  的话，说明 Detroit 队还有赢的希望，否则 Detroit 队没有赢的可能。现在我们如下建模"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_43d6468e-4496-4a42-b617-f1d409426fe1.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个图分为三部分，第一部分"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a6c74abe-6191-4b18-adc9-62b84ad4110e.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中权值表示比赛场次，比如 s → NY-Bal 这条边的权值为 5，表示 NY 与 Bal 之间有五场比赛要打，可见这四个队伍总共要打 5 + 8 + 7 + 2 + 7 = 27 场比赛。第二部分"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dbdd4751-e4d3-4826-8bce-f4bd16ddf752.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这次的权值表示的是胜场的分配。第三部分"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3dabf390-fb6c-4953-b0e3-692eb6aadf5e.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这时其中的权值表示每个队最多赢多少次，例如 NY 队目前 75 分，它最多只能赢一场。如果上述网络流的最大流大于等于比赛的总场次，所以存在一种方案能够分配所有胜场使得所有队的得分最多只有 76 分。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面网络流我们建模为如下图"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"11 19\n0 1 3\n0 2 8\n0 3 7\n0 4 2\n0 5 7\n1 6 3\n1 7 3\n2 6 8\n2 8 8\n3 6 7\n3 9 7\n4 7 2\n4 8 2\n5 7 7\n7 9 7\n6 10 1\n7 10 5\n8 10 7\n9 10 13","language":"java","uuid":"74d1c32c-1cd0-49ca-b2d3-ff144fdeaf39","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在我们用之前写的 MaxFlow 类来查看最大流是多少"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"public class BaseBallSolution {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        DirectedWeightedGraph baseball = new DirectedWeightedGraph(\"g17.txt\");\n        MaxFlow maxflow = new MaxFlow(baseball, 0, 10);\n        System.out.println(maxflow.result());\n    }\n}","language":"java","uuid":"73c32d6c-49ae-4ac6-8a41-44c5e89416d8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"结果是"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"26","language":"java","uuid":"aa43a0f6-a4d5-4f9f-8ae0-bd174ec939ce","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"说明最大流为 26，小于 27，说明无法分配 27 场比赛使得所有队最多只能赢 76 场，这就意味着 Detroit 没有赢的可能了。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"网络流与最大流","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:631","type":"doc","id":631}},{"label":"棒球比赛","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:634","type":"doc","id":634}}],"prevPage":{"title":"Edmonds-Karp 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:633","type":"doc","id":633}},"nextPage":{"title":"匹配问题","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:635","type":"doc","id":635}},"createTime":1702133747160,"updateTime":1743303640563,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640563}}